    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be defined as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>k</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to :"
