  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math></p><p>Thus <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is a natural number</p><p>Thus <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cot</mi><mn>21</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>21</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>21</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>21</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>21</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>1</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>21</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>cosec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>1</mn><mi>cosec</mi><mn>21</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mo>cosec</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>cosec</mo><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced></math></p>"
